flowchart LR
    A[emnist-letters-train.csv] --> C[preprocess_and_cache]
    B[emnist-letters-test.csv] --> C

    C --> D[Extract labels and pixel matrix]
    D --> E[Reshape to 28x28 images]
    E --> F[Transpose orientation]
    F --> G[Normalize pixels]
    G --> H[Add channel dimension]
    H --> I[One-hot encode labels]
    I --> J[Save cache<br/>emnist_letters_cache.npz]

    J --> K[Train or load CNN]
    K --> L[Conv2D 32 filters]
    L --> M[MaxPooling]
    M --> N[Conv2D 64 filters]
    N --> O[MaxPooling]
    O --> P[Flatten]
    P --> Q[Dense 128]
    Q --> R[Dropout 0.25]
    R --> S[Dense 26 softmax]

    S --> T[Evaluate on test set]
    T --> U[test_accuracy + test_loss]
    T --> V[sample_predictions.json]
    T --> W[confusion_matrix.csv]
    T --> X[model_architecture.json]
    T --> Y[summary.md]

    S --> Z[Gradio demo inference]
    Z --> AA[User draws letter]
    AA --> AB[prepare_image_for_inference]
    AB --> AC[Predict probabilities for a-z]